                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Computes adjacency relationships among a list of polylines. Polylines do not need to share points to be matched as adjacent cells; edge alignment is the key criterion. This component offers three computation modes with different complexity levels and is most useful for very complex networks.</item>
